    <p>[++++++++++++]</p>
    <p>Invite previously selected students to share their picture book page. The lesson synthesis will focus on this page.</p>
  </li>


  <!-- Descripción del desarrollo de lenguaje matemático -->
  <!-- <li>
    <title><custom ref="language-actividad-titulo"/></title>
